From 33238d078797225d63cf39ed89c2bcec3347d5da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Basanagouda Nagappa Koppad <basanagouda.nagappa.koppad@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:34:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/19] pps: add Android data source names to sample configs

From Intel A17 25.0.1 a8b717c0991 ("Perfetto: Fix
CtsGpuProfilingDataTest fail"). Only the sample tracing configs are
carried: the rest of that change (Android "gpu.counters" /
"gpu.renderstages" data source names, skipping failing drivers,
libgpudataproducer start() entry point) is upstream in Mesa 26.0.3.

The Intel metric set property persist.vendor.intel.perfetto.metric_set
is replaced by upstream's os_get_option() lookup of
INTEL_PERFETTO_METRIC_SET, i.e. vendor.mesa.intel.perfetto.metric.set
on Android.

Tracked-On: OAM-128278
(cherry picked from commit a8b717c0991981ea783d95ac0127c4dbc36c62f9)
Tracked-On: NIACP3-1589
Signed-off-by: Basanagouda Nagappa Koppad <basanagouda.nagappa.koppad@intel.com>
---
 src/tool/pps/cfg/gpu.cfg    |  9 +++++++++
 src/tool/pps/cfg/intel.cfg  | 15 +++++++++++++++
 src/tool/pps/cfg/system.cfg | 15 +++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 39 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/tool/pps/cfg/gpu.cfg b/src/tool/pps/cfg/gpu.cfg
index 2a6578375d82..3e85c3e0e188 100644
--- a/src/tool/pps/cfg/gpu.cfg
+++ b/src/tool/pps/cfg/gpu.cfg
@@ -30,4 +30,13 @@ data_sources {
   }
 }
 
+data_sources {
+  config {
+    name: "gpu.counters"
+    gpu_counter_config {
+      counter_period_ns: 1000000000
+    }
+  }
+}
+
 duration_ms: 16000
diff --git a/src/tool/pps/cfg/intel.cfg b/src/tool/pps/cfg/intel.cfg
index bb9e2d22dbce..4b9ce40099a2 100644
--- a/src/tool/pps/cfg/intel.cfg
+++ b/src/tool/pps/cfg/intel.cfg
@@ -58,6 +58,21 @@ data_sources {
   }
 }
 
+data_sources {
+  config {
+    name: "gpu.counters"
+    gpu_counter_config {
+      counter_period_ns: 100000
+    }
+  }
+}
+
+data_sources {
+  config {
+    name: "gpu.renderstages"
+  }
+}
+
 data_sources {
   config {
     name: "track_event"
diff --git a/src/tool/pps/cfg/system.cfg b/src/tool/pps/cfg/system.cfg
index 2e6ce480bb27..493415e5f24d 100644
--- a/src/tool/pps/cfg/system.cfg
+++ b/src/tool/pps/cfg/system.cfg
@@ -82,6 +82,21 @@ data_sources {
   }
 }
 
+data_sources {
+  config {
+    name: "gpu.counters"
+    gpu_counter_config {
+      counter_period_ns: 100000
+    }
+  }
+}
+
+data_sources {
+  config {
+    name: "gpu.renderstages"
+  }
+}
+
 data_sources {
   config {
     name: "track_event"
